{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28475","headline":"酬张祜处士见寄长句四韵 · 杜牧","name":"酬张祜处士见寄长句四韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"七子论诗谁似公，曹刘须在指挥中。\n荐衡昔日知文举，乞火无人作蒯通。\n北极楼台长挂梦，西江波浪远吞空。\n可怜故国三千里，虚唱歌词满六宫。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜牧","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_28475.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28475","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}